<title>USA: Fairchild Corp cuts Q2 Dec 29 loss.</title>
<headline>Fairchild Corp cuts Q2 Dec 29 loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHANTILLY, Va. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.18     loss	 $0.35</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,977     loss	 5,603</p>
<p> Revs		     159,912		  103,450</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,551		   16,130</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.46     loss	 $0.68</p>
<p> Net loss		   7,595     loss	11,039</p>
<p> Revs		     306,002		  211,376</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	16,489		   16,122</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company became 60 percent shareholder of Banner Aerospace Inc in February 1996 and began consolidating its results with Fairchild.</p>
<p>1995 includes gains from earnings from discontinued operations of $0.21 a share and $0.45 a share in Q2 and six month periods respectively.</p>
